---
title: ProximaDB - Iceberg Manifest Lifecycle (Warehouse / OLAP Tables)
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Catalog as Catalog<br/>(proximadb-catalog)
    participant Iceberg as IcebergEngine<br/>(proximadb-iceberg-engine)
    participant Manifest as ManifestCommitter
    participant ObjectStore as ProximaObjectStore<br/>(S3/GCS/Azure Blob)
    participant DataFusion as DataFusion<br/>(OLAP Scan)

    Note over Client,DataFusion: ALTER TABLE ... MATERIALIZE — converts to Parquet/Iceberg

    Client->>Catalog: ALTER TABLE orders MATERIALIZE
    Catalog->>Iceberg: materialize_table(tenant, namespace, table)
    Iceberg->>Iceberg: Read WAL / RecordStorage records
    Iceberg->>Iceberg: Build Arrow RecordBatches
    Iceberg->>Iceberg: Partition by column(s) if specified

    Iceberg->>Iceberg: Write Parquet data files
    Iceberg->>ObjectStore: PUT data/{tenant}/{ns}/tables/orders/data/00000-0.parquet
    Iceberg->>ObjectStore: PUT data/{tenant}/{ns}/tables/orders/data/00001-0.parquet

    Iceberg->>Manifest: commit_fenced(manifest_list)
    Note over Manifest: CAS put_if_absent on successor slot<br/>Generation header fences stale writers

    Manifest->>ObjectStore: PUT .../metadata/v1.metadata.json (table metadata)
    Manifest->>ObjectStore: PUT .../metadata/snap-{id}.avro (manifest list)
    Manifest->>ObjectStore: PUT .../metadata/{id}-m0.avro (manifest file)

    Manifest-->>Iceberg: CommitOutcome::Success(new_version)
    Iceberg-->>Catalog: Table now parquet-backed, OLAP-capable

    Note over Client,DataFusion: SELECT * FROM orders WHERE date > '2026-01-01' (via pgwire)

    Client->>DataFusion: SQL query (via pgwire → ComputeScheduler)
    DataFusion->>Iceberg: List snapshots
    Iceberg->>ObjectStore: GET .../metadata/ (list latest snapshot)
    DataFusion->>Iceberg: Resolve manifest
    Iceberg->>ObjectStore: GET .../metadata/snap-{id}.avro
    Iceberg->>ObjectStore: GET .../metadata/{id}-m0.avro
    Iceberg-->>DataFusion: Partition specs + data file paths

    DataFusion->>ObjectStore: GET .../data/00000-0.parquet (range: predicate pruned)
    DataFusion->>ObjectStore: GET .../data/00001-0.parquet
    DataFusion-->>Client: Arrow RecordBatch results

    Note over Iceberg,ObjectStore: Iceberg spec: table metadata → snapshot → manifest list → manifest → data files
